<view class="screen">
  <view class="topbar">
    <view class="topbar-back" bindtap="skip">跳过</view>
    <view class="topbar-title">新手引导</view>
    <view class="topbar-right">第 {{idx + 1}}/{{total}} 步</view>
  </view>

  <view class="body">
    <view class="conclusion guide-hero">
      <view class="guide-step-pill">STEP {{idx + 1}} / {{total}}</view>
      <view class="conclusion-head">{{step.title}}</view>
      <view class="term-bar" style="margin-top:16rpx;">
        <view class="term-bar-fill" style="width:{{(idx + 1) * 100 / total}}%;"></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="guide-body-text">{{step.body}}</view>
      <view class="guide-tip-box">{{step.tip}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="guide-actions">
        <view class="btn" style="flex:1;{{idx === 0 ? 'opacity:0.4;' : ''}}" bindtap="prev">上一步</view>
        <view class="btn btn-primary" style="flex:2;" bindtap="next">{{isLast ? '开始使用' : '下一步'}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="btn" style="margin-top:14rpx;" bindtap="skip">跳过引导，直接使用</view>
    </view>

    <view class="footnote">
      引导只在首次进入时自动弹出，之后可在「设置 → 新手引导」重新查看。全部推算在本机完成，不上传任何数据。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
